flowchart TD
A[Start with the analytical question] --> B{How many variables?}
B -->|One continuous| C[Histogram]
B -->|Continuous + category| D[Box Plot]
B -->|Two continuous| E{Are observations sequentially connected?}
B -->|Category + metric| F{Need log scale or multiple metrics?}
E -->|Yes| G[Line Plot]
E -->|No| H[Scatter Plot]
F -->|Yes| I[Dot Plot]
F -->|No| J[Bar Plot]

flowchart TD
Q[What is the job?] --> C{Compare categories?}
C -->|Yes| B[Clustered bar / column. Sort. Zero baseline.]
Q --> T{Connected sequence?}
T -->|Yes| L[Line. Not a bar of months unless ranking months.]
Q --> R{Relationship / outliers?}
R -->|Yes| S[Scatter. Trend is a diagnosis, not causality.]
Q --> G{Same view across groups?}
G -->|Yes| M[Small multiples. Same scale.]
Q --> X{Need drivers, not a pretty chart?}
X -->|Yes| D[Decomposition tree / drill-through. Key Influencers stay exploratory.]

flowchart TD
P[Page feels slow] --> A[Performance Analyzer]
A --> V{Visual time?}
V -->|Yes| V2[Fewer visuals. Drop cross-highlight. Top N + Other.]
A --> Q{Query / measure time?}
Q -->|Yes| Q2[Simplify measures. Avoid iterator overkill. Star schema.]
A --> M{Model size?}
M -->|Yes| M2[Stop calculated columns that should be measures. Reduce grain.]

flowchart TD
C[Conversion went up] --> D{Did the denominator change?}
D -->|Yes| Mix[Mix / traffic source / seasonality]
D -->|No| U{Is the interval tight enough to act?}
U -->|No| Wait[Show uncertainty. Do not ship a story.]
U -->|Yes| P{Is the lift large enough to matter?}
P -->|No| Prac[Statistically real, practically small]
P -->|Yes| Act[Then look at segments before you celebrate]
